Product photos go here.

Drop a file in this folder and point a product's `image` at it:

    public/images/storm-cloud.jpg   ->   image: "/images/storm-cloud.jpg"

Anything under public/ is served from the site root, so the "public/" part
disappears from the URL. Square, ~1200x1200, under ~300KB each works well.

Leave image: null and you get a generated placeholder tile instead, so the
site looks finished before you have photographed anything.
